	(text "Hardware off timer: holding the power button for ~4-9 s turns the MCU rail off even if the firmware hangs\n(Q29 releases C172, U23 trips, Q30 pulls PWR-LATCH low). Firmware turns off at 3 s.\nWhile charging, the rail-hold (Q31 on BATTERY-CHARGER, from DC-IN-20V) keeps the MCU rail on regardless,\nand charger power alone turns the MCU rail on (Q31 pulls PWR-SW-G low)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24.892 236.22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "05372955-2756-40df-8455-1a35676292a0")
	)
	(text "3.3V SENSORS POWER RAIL\n\n- C176 keeps Q16 off when power switches ON\n- C64 soft-ramps power\n- set VSENS_3V3_EN LOW to enable sensors power"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 326.898 79.756 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0f4cd1a6-ff47-4e80-bc30-99d4070b2d95")
	)
	(text "5V USB, SENSORS, LiDAR POWER RAIL\n- set 5V_EN HIGH to enable\n\nTPS54560B (U21, U22):\n- non-synchronous\n- COMP 4.7k + 47nF (all-ceramic Cout, no pole cap)\n- SS56 catch diode; Fsw 418 kHz (RT 232k)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 105.41 36.83 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5ea78fbd-f109-4185-b50f-fbd6040e13e7")
	)
	(text "C176 gate-source cap, 10x C64: holds Q16 off while VCC-3V3 ramps up"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 351.536 24.638 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "9628b9b1-cd65-42f2-946d-10b8f6fa6039")
	)
	(text "14.5V ULTRASONIC CARPET SENSOR POWER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170.18 198.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ab7dece4-24de-4f54-83d7-cbf99fa6a482")
	)
	(text "TPS54560B RT: fsw = 92417 x RT(k)^-0.991 = 418 kHz"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 59.436 78.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "ac601ad5-475b-4c34-b873-421dce4f84d0")
	)
	(text "MOTOR POWER RAIL 14.4V\n\n- on/off motor power, no soft ramp\n- set VMOT-14V4-EN LOW to enable power\n  - floating (MCU flash/reset) disables power\n- WD_OK LOW shuts power off\n\nVMOT-14V4: Q1 + Q37 AO4407C in parallel\n- ~7.5 A normal (with the MSD-G fan) is ~0.25 W each\n- short stall peaks (~13 A) fine with copper under the drain\n- Vgs +/-25 V, no gate divider needed\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 238.76 59.69 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c60952ba-300f-42b7-8bc9-3b41711b6f9d")
	)
	(text "VUSONIC-14V4 = 0.6V x (1 + 232k/10k) ~= 14.5V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 212.09 241.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "d8121408-7b4f-4c1a-92af-c064e178e8a5")
	)
	(text "MCU VBAT\n- Low quiescent current 2.5μA\n- Zener diode shuts off when main battery is low"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 298.704 201.168 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f3a51cfa-84b8-4f6d-b328-71f0367ad744")
	)
	(text "3.3V MCU POWER RAIL\n\n- POWER_EN is 14.4V\n- set POWER_EN HIGH to enable\n\nTPS54560B (U21, U22):\n- non-synchronous\n- COMP 4.7k + 47nF (all-ceramic Cout, no pole cap)\n- SS56 catch diode; fsw 418 kHz (RT 232k)\n- EN abs max 8.4 V: R207/R208 on U21"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 249.174 125.476 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fbb1d7fe-0e6c-4149-98d9-73391c935980")
	)
	(text_box "Power off -> user pushes POWER-BTN -> Q13 enables MCU 3.3V rail -> MCU leaves STM-PWR-CTRL floating -> MCU enables other power rails as needed\nPower on -> user pushes POWER-BTN -> MCU detects PWR-BTN-SENSE press -> firmware acts as needed, including turning off all power rails including MCU 3.3V itself by driving STM-PWR-CTRL low\nPower on -> MCU hung -> user pushes POWER-BTN for ~5 seconds -> Q13 shuts off MCU 3.3V rail -> all other power rails shut off\nautomatically when MCU GPIOs float"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 87.63 150.8654 0)
		(size 64.77 24.3946)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -0.0001)
			(type solid)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1769907a-56f8-4436-975f-3e99f1c91c69")
	)
